# The generic .gitignore.
#
# A general-purpose set of ignore rules (Node, JVM, Gradle, Maven, Python, IDEs, OS, media, secrets,
# build and test leftovers), merged into one list: sections A→Z, patterns A→Z within each section
# (plain `LC_ALL=C sort`), no duplicates.
#
# The one exception to A→Z is the Exceptions section itself, which must stay last: in .gitignore the
# last matching rule wins, and it re-includes files the rules above would otherwise hide.
#
# Learn more about .gitignore:
#     https://www.atlassian.com/git/tutorials/saving-changes/gitignore

