### Parth build and test leftovers ###
#   /models/ and /results/ are project-root only: packages/core/src/models/ is source code.
#   packages/vscode/media/webview.html is copied from packages/webview-ui/dist by the extension build.
#   parth-conformance-* is what the conformance suite creates (and normally deletes) in the workspace under test.
.parth/
/models/
/results/
packages/vscode/media/webview.html
parth-conformance-*

