### VS Code ###
#   Personal settings stay local; the shared launch/tasks/recommendations (F5 "Run Extension") are committed.
#   The contents are ignored rather than the folder itself, so those files can be re-included below.
**/.vscode/*
*.vsix
.vscode-test/

### Exceptions — keep last: in .gitignore the last matching rule wins ###
#   Files the rules above would hide but that must be committed. A folder has to be re-included
#   before the files in it, or git never looks inside it.
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
!**/.vscode/launch.json
!**/.vscode/tasks.json
!**/gradle/
!**/gradle/wrapper/
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!**/gradlew
!**/gradlew.bat
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!gradle-wrapper.properties
